[SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE & CORE PIPELINE]
• Frameworks    : Python 3.8+, Streamlit, Pandas
• Data Feed     : Simulated 1Hz (1-second) live hardware loop
• Data Handling : Streamlit Session State (st.session_state) for real-time metrics

[AUTOMATED STATE MACHINE CONTROL LOGIC]
• Dry Condition : Moisture ≤ Threshold → Alert 'CRITICAL: DRY START' & Pump ON
• Wet Condition : Moisture ≥ Threshold → Alert 'CRITICAL: WET STOP' & Pump OFF
• Safe Zone     : Moisture between thresholds maintains existing state

[LOCAL DATA FILE SCHEMATICS]
• Log File      : telemetry_log.csv (Dynamic, per-second appending)
• Schema        : Timestamp, Moisture (%), State, Dry_Limit_Set, Wet_Limit_Set
